# Accepted Trivy findings. Each entry needs a reason.

# KSV-0113: Role can read Secrets in the Argo CD namespace.
# kubechecks reuses Argo CD's settings manager and repository DB, which
# list and watch every Secret and ConfigMap in argocd.namespace to find
# repository and cluster credentials. RBAC can't filter list/watch by label,
# and the Role is already read-only (get/list/watch) and limited to that one
# namespace. Cluster-wide access stays behind rbac.clusterWideSecrets (off).
KSV-0113

# KSV-0125: "image from an untrusted registry". Trivy's trusted list doesn't
# include ghcr.io, where both upstream and placer images are published.
KSV-0125
